  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">POF - Pioneer Outcomes Funds</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A programme to leverage private finance into high performing development projects using Impact Bonds and other pay-for-outcomes models at scale to deliver the Sustainable Development Goals.

A multi-donor programme to commission development projects effectively and efficiently using new instruments that facilitate better links between financial markets and providers delivering pay-for-success contracts.</narrative>
  </description>
